{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/SpinLock.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/SpinLock.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"spin lock spin lock","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/SpinLock.md","fileName":"SpinLock.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"SpinLock","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 00:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[.NET Synchronization and Thread Coordination]]","tags":["baby"],"links":[".NET Synchronization and Thread Coordination","hands-onparallelprogrammingwithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/SpinLock.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/SpinLock.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"spin lock spin lock","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/SpinLock.md","fileName":"SpinLock.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"SpinLock","heading":"SpinLock","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"`SpinLock` protects a critical section by waiting actively rather than immediately blocking the thread. It can reduce scheduler overhead when contention is rare and the holder releases the lock in only a few instructions.\n\nBecause it is a value type, copying it can accidentally create independent locks, and thread-owner tracking adds diagnostic cost. Long work, I/O, or unpredictable scheduling inside the protected region makes spinning wasteful and favors a blocking lock.","tags":["baby"],"links":[".NET Synchronization and Thread Coordination","hands-onparallelprogrammingwithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/SpinLock.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/SpinLock.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"spin lock spin lock","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/SpinLock.md","fileName":"SpinLock.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"SpinLock","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[hands-onparallelprogrammingwithc8andnetcore3.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":[".NET Synchronization and Thread Coordination","hands-onparallelprogrammingwithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}